{"type": "mcq", "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">For the linear function <math alttext=\"h\"><mi>h</mi>\n</math>, <math alttext=\"h left parenthesis 0 right parenthesis equals 0\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and&nbsp;<math alttext=\"h left parenthesis 11 right parenthesis equals 10\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></math>. Which equation defines <math alttext=\"h\"><mi>h</mi>\n</math>?</p>", "keys": ["12d99120-c4cf-4a1e-950b-1fb7ebb098bb"], "answerOptions": [{"id": "12d99120-c4cf-4a1e-950b-1fb7ebb098bb", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals StartFraction 10 Over 11 EndFraction x\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>x</mi></math></p>"}, {"id": "81926976-c6f0-419b-8d1e-c99d8e663fac", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals StartFraction 10 Over 11 EndFraction x plus 10\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></math></p>"}, {"id": "5cadcea9-aa08-42b6-95cc-489c04662bd5", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals StartFraction 11 Over 10 EndFraction x\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>x</mi></math></p>"}, {"id": "b2e77a5b-3738-4d33-829a-bf38ef73d689", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals StartFraction 11 Over 10 EndFraction x plus 11\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></math></p>"}], "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is correct. Since <math alttext=\"h\"><mi>h</mi>\n</math> is a linear function, it can be defined by an equation of the form <math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals m x plus b\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math>, where <math alttext=\"m\"><mi>m</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi>\n</math> are constants. It's given that <math alttext=\"h left parenthesis 0 right parenthesis equals 0\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn>\n</math> for <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn>\n</math> for&nbsp;<math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> in the equation&nbsp;<math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals m x plus b\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math> yields <math alttext=\"0 equals 0 m plus b\"><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math>, or <math alttext=\"0 equals b\"><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn>\n</math> for <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi>\n</math> in the equation&nbsp;<math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals m x plus b\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math> yields <math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals m x\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi></math>. It's also given that <math alttext=\"h left parenthesis 11 right parenthesis equals 10\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mn>11</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"11\"><mn>11</mn>\n</math> for <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"10\"><mn>10</mn>\n</math> for&nbsp;<math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> in the equation&nbsp;<math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals m x\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi></math> yields <math alttext=\"10 equals 11 m\"><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>m</mi></math>. Dividing both sides of this equation by <math alttext=\"11\"><mn>11</mn>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"m equals StartFraction 10 Over 11 EndFraction\"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>11</mn></mfrac></math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"StartFraction 10 Over 11 EndFraction\"><mfrac>\n<mn>10</mn>\n<mn>11</mn>\n</mfrac>\n</math> for <math alttext=\"m\"><mi>m</mi>\n</math> in the equation&nbsp;<math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals m x\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi></math> yields <math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals StartFraction 10 Over 11 EndFraction x\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>11</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi></math>. Therefore, an equation that defines <math alttext=\"h\"><mi>h</mi>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals StartFraction 10 Over 11 EndFraction x\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>11</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>", "externalid": "a76b700a-7987-4650-b3bd-3b739ce06f18", "correct_answer": ["A"]}